# Second Brain scheduled tasks
# All times in local timezone. Adjust hours to your timezone.
# Use Claude Code's /schedule command to create each task as a remote agent.

# Nightly journal: export meetings, enrich transcripts, write daily log
# 0 20 * * *   Nightly Journal

# Meeting debriefs: research and prep tomorrow's calendar
# 30 20 * * *  Meeting Debriefs

# Weekly rollup: synthesize the week (Sunday only)
# 0 21 * * 0   Weekly Rollup

# Daily kickoff: morning accountability DM via Slack
# 0 0 * * *    Daily Kickoff

# Manual execution (from work-automation repo):
# claude -p < ~/github-projects/work-automation/scripts/tasks/nightly-journal.prompt.md
